      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "OBJECTIVE",
          "Label": "AIMS",
          "content": "To evaluate internal consistency and test-retest reliability of the Iranian version of the Angina Pectoris characteristics questionnaire."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "BACKGROUND",
          "Label": "BACKGROUND",
          "content": "To evaluate symptoms in patients with Angina Pectoris, the Iranian version of the Angina Pectoris characteristics questionnaire was created by combining items from Modified Rose Questionnaire, Short Form-McGill Questionnaire and the Accompanying Symptom Checklist. The Angina Pectoris characteristics questionnaire has been developed and validated recently although it required assessment of its reliability."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "DESIGN",
          "content": "Reliability study using test and retest."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "METHOD",
          "content": "One hundred and ten coronary heart disease patients with Angina Pectoris were included. The test-retest reliability of the instrument was estimated for measurement after 15 days."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "RESULTS",
          "Label": "RESULT",
          "content": "The analysis of the result indicated that internal consistency was found adequate at both assessments (Cronbach's alpha = 0.65) for test and retest. There was no significant difference between test and retest. The intra-class correlation coefficient ranged from 0.76-0.98."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSION",
          "content": "The Angina Pectoris characteristics questionnaire is a reliable instrument for the assessment of Angina Pectoris characteristics in a Persian population."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "RELEVANCE TO CLINICAL PRACTICE",
          "content": "The Angina Pectoris characteristics questionnaire can be used with confidence in Iranian coronary heart disease patients for Assessing Angina Pectoris symptom."
        }
      ]},
